{
  "S1": [
    {
      "text": "It's six forty-five",
      "start": 0.05,
      "end": 0.9
    },
    {
      "text": "in the morning.",
      "start": 0.92,
      "end": 1.69
    },
    {
      "text": "Marco just called in sick.",
      "start": 1.71,
      "end": 3.31
    },
    {
      "text": "Four customers are waiting",
      "start": 3.33,
      "end": 4.39
    },
    {
      "text": "for him today.",
      "start": 4.41,
      "end": 5.38
    },
    {
      "text": "Who covers his jobs?",
      "start": 5.4,
      "end": 6.86
    },
    {
      "text": "Figuring that out",
      "start": 6.88,
      "end": 7.59
    },
    {
      "text": "by hand takes an hour.",
      "start": 7.61,
      "end": 9.07
    },
    {
      "text": "Second Shift does it",
      "start": 9.09,
      "end": 9.92
    },
    {
      "text": "in seconds.",
      "start": 9.94,
      "end": 10.91
    }
  ],
  "S2": [
    {
      "text": "Someone posts in Slack:",
      "start": 0.06,
      "end": 1.15
    },
    {
      "text": "Marco is out.",
      "start": 1.17,
      "end": 2.27
    },
    {
      "text": "Second Shift reads it,",
      "start": 2.29,
      "end": 3.4
    },
    {
      "text": "then looks at every job",
      "start": 3.42,
      "end": 4.47
    },
    {
      "text": "and every calendar.",
      "start": 4.49,
      "end": 5.65
    }
  ],
  "S3": [
    {
      "text": "It builds a new plan.",
      "start": 0.05,
      "end": 1.22
    },
    {
      "text": "Watch the trucks move.",
      "start": 1.24,
      "end": 2.67
    },
    {
      "text": "Wei can do Marco's",
      "start": 2.69,
      "end": 3.54
    },
    {
      "text": "big gas job,",
      "start": 3.56,
      "end": 4.26
    },
    {
      "text": "but he's busy.",
      "start": 4.28,
      "end": 5.43
    },
    {
      "text": "So Ana takes",
      "start": 5.45,
      "end": 6.09
    },
    {
      "text": "Wei's small job,",
      "start": 6.11,
      "end": 7.05
    },
    {
      "text": "and Wei takes Marco's.",
      "start": 7.07,
      "end": 8.58
    },
    {
      "text": "One job can't",
      "start": 8.6,
      "end": 9.25
    },
    {
      "text": "be saved today,",
      "start": 9.27,
      "end": 10.13
    },
    {
      "text": "so that customer is asked",
      "start": 10.15,
      "end": 11.16
    },
    {
      "text": "to pick a new time.",
      "start": 11.18,
      "end": 12.31
    }
  ],
  "S4": [
    {
      "text": "Nothing changes until",
      "start": 0.04,
      "end": 1.07
    },
    {
      "text": "a person says yes.",
      "start": 1.09,
      "end": 2.55
    },
    {
      "text": "One click,",
      "start": 2.57,
      "end": 3.2
    },
    {
      "text": "and it updates the calendars",
      "start": 3.22,
      "end": 4.53
    },
    {
      "text": "and the job sheet,",
      "start": 4.55,
      "end": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "messages the team in Slack,",
      "start": 5.46,
      "end": 6.82
    },
    {
      "text": "and emails the customers.",
      "start": 6.84,
      "end": 8.38
    }
  ],
  "S5": [
    {
      "text": "Then it double-checks every change.",
      "start": 0.06,
      "end": 1.81
    },
    {
      "text": "Thirty-six out of thirty-six.",
      "start": 1.83,
      "end": 3.66
    },
    {
      "text": "If it crashes halfway,",
      "start": 3.68,
      "end": 4.86
    },
    {
      "text": "it finishes",
      "start": 4.88,
      "end": 5.37
    },
    {
      "text": "without sending anything twice.",
      "start": 5.39,
      "end": 7.19
    },
    {
      "text": "And you can ask:",
      "start": 7.21,
      "end": 8.0
    },
    {
      "text": "what if Wei",
      "start": 8.02,
      "end": 8.47
    },
    {
      "text": "doesn't show up?",
      "start": 8.49,
      "end": 9.56
    },
    {
      "text": "It shows you,",
      "start": 9.58,
      "end": 10.16
    },
    {
      "text": "before it happens.",
      "start": 10.18,
      "end": 11.4
    }
  ],
  "S6": [
    {
      "text": "Sick days,",
      "start": 0.04,
      "end": 0.63
    },
    {
      "text": "flat tires, no-shows.",
      "start": 0.65,
      "end": 2.45
    },
    {
      "text": "They'll keep happening.",
      "start": 2.47,
      "end": 3.77
    },
    {
      "text": "Now they take seconds",
      "start": 3.79,
      "end": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "to fix,",
      "start": 4.7,
      "end": 5.43
    },
    {
      "text": "not an hour.",
      "start": 5.45,
      "end": 6.35
    },
    {
      "text": "We can't predict the day.",
      "start": 6.37,
      "end": 7.59
    },
    {
      "text": "But we can be ready",
      "start": 7.61,
      "end": 8.37
    },
    {
      "text": "for it.",
      "start": 8.39,
      "end": 9.15
    },
    {
      "text": "Second Shift.",
      "start": 9.17,
      "end": 10.19
    }
  ]
}